      "writtenOn": "2023-06-01T18:03:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You should always check the return value of `kmalloc()` to see if it returned NULL. However, I think it might actually be cleaner to embed these structures inside of the `mod_plt_sec` structure. That\u0027ll save having to allocate the memory for those structures here, as well as having to deallocate it later.",
      "revId": "139b4cde28acd00c07ed864f0ef6b0f69756e518",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5c8e4785_14c64c8b",
        "filename": "arch/arm64/kernel/module-plts.c",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 336,
